  "notes": "{左右|さゆう} has two main meanings: \"left and right\" (spatial) and \"to influence/affect\" (figurative).\n\nSPATIAL MEANING:\n- {左右|さゆう}を{確認|かくにん}する: to look both ways\n- {左右|さゆう}{対称|たいしょう}: bilateral symmetry\n- {左右|さゆう}に{分|わ}かれる: to split left and right\n\nFIGURATIVE MEANING (する verb):\n- {運命|うんめい}を{左右|さゆう}する: to affect one's fate\n- {結果|けっか}を{左右|さゆう}する: to influence the outcome\n- {判断|はんだん}を{左右|さゆう}する: to sway a decision\n\nNOTE:\nThe figurative sense of \"influencing\" comes from the image of causing something to go one way or the other (left or right).",
